 communication solution and virtual collaboration services. It also provides security and surveillance services, including CCTV cameras, IP surveillance, access control system, and industry-specific security solutions; computing, data center switching, and security in converged and hyper-converged data centers; and cloud and managed services, such as platform as a service, software as a service, infrastructure as a service, and cloud security services, as well as maintenance and technical and support services. It serves the telecom, information technology, information technology-enabled services, energy, public administration, enterprise, education, railways, and defense sectors. Takyon Networks Limited was founded in 2009 and is based in Lucknow, India.","employees":154,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795784376},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795784376,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Takyon Networks\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Takyon Networks H1 FY27: A ₹4,000 CCTV Camera Costs ₹12,000, and a Lucknow Integrator Pays the Difference","s":"Howl.Link","d":1795769384,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiO0FVX3lxTE1zc3R6azBBem80VVVwZjc5UUhmbFdGN1FkZS1FcmNMMU0zVm8zT0UwXzJXc2ZhNlQ3U2FR?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Takyon Networks H1FY27 Results: Net loss ₹845 lakh, Q2 revenue doubles","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795663042,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOWXJIa1hYMElaeEdVUnpRRV9pNHpOTVZSOEJQSEh5Z3pNa2RtYU84YVFsZnlVd3U5S2JHaHNaYUFWVnhWeWMza1Q1djJDOW9zUDRPdmNoZldYZjUzX25HSWdVbV9Udlk2RXptcTZ0c2VoMzlXRi1qd1VNNmQ4OU1aamROaWctVnBkU1NOeUFlTmtQTVhpT2RxNjhZS2d6aFU3LXEtZkExaGpzR2dHUTZWbExSazNXMHlySEdWb0Fibw?oc=5","g":["neg"]},{"t":"Takyon Networks Ltd expects Rs 36 crore H2 FY27 billing","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1795618288,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQTnZqOFo4YlJUUks0T0xwVTNRU0RDbjR5NURGV2VqVmUzLUZIal9QaTVWNUFjWUloSUpDNHUzOEh6eU44V1FwY